{
  "name": "@polypack/host-taro",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Taro 宿主工程（T-M3-06）：装配 @polypack/adapter-taro + 微信/支付宝/抖音三平台编译（快应用走编译工程，口径见 test/host-structure.test.js）",
  "browserslist": [
    "defaults and fully supports es6-module",
